  m_text: "\xB7Dollar Express Feature will be triggered when either<sprite name=\"mykd_sm_$\">or<sprite
    name=\"mykd_sm_cmjhc\">appears on reel 5, and<sprite name=\"mykd_sm_hhc\">\u3001<sprite
    name=\"mykd_sm_zhc\">\u3001<sprite name=\"mykd_sm_lanhc\">\u3001<sprite name=\"mykd_sm_lhc\">\uFF0Cor<sprite
    name=\"mykd_sm_jz\">appears on reels 1,2,3 or 4.\n\xB73 or more<sprite name=\"mykd_sm_jz\">trigger
    Choice Feature.\n\xB7Collect<sprite name=\"mykd_sm_jz\">to invest in the nation
    and win big!\n\xB7<sprite name=\"mykd_sm_wild\">substitutes for all symbols except<sprite
    name=\"mykd_sm_kc\">, <sprite name=\"mykd_sm_jz\">,<sprite name=\"mykd_sm_hhc\">,<sprite
